      "passageSha256": "9d41e565fb90585857109b20391a414b8e4ef5b01ef5ef9d48891915e021da58",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0133",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-s002",
      "sentenceText": "When you moved to a new city, where did you rent first?",
      "sentenceSha256": "f915a9367f9d1d46a35d598f8acd29311d488cf5fec2aedf8e4905341e3c2fb2",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-081",
      "parentFingerprint": "40f28a6b3613930739f5c338863c71de0df711e823010c1e7b359863efb8aafb",
      "passageSha256": "9d41e565fb90585857109b20391a414b8e4ef5b01ef5ef9d48891915e021da58",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0134",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-s003",
      "sentenceText": "If you eventually bought a house in that city, where was it?",
      "sentenceSha256": "eb41d38b4fd05add767ee0a0c2d08eb50d67854e9e37b279154277accbcf618f",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-081",
      "parentFingerprint": "40f28a6b3613930739f5c338863c71de0df711e823010c1e7b359863efb8aafb",
      "passageSha256": "9d41e565fb90585857109b20391a414b8e4ef5b01ef5ef9d48891915e021da58",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0135",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-s005",
      "sentenceText": "When I first moved to the University of Minnesota, we rented an apartment in downtown Saint Paul for one year.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4fc3dd3cdc446454a9b6ce1ff415e080a310c746161aa42857feacc30c0283de",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-082",
      "parentFingerprint": "4feb7241a08875d6989441af702f080c3e3110dab3b7195d20b0d41457bbb9ba",
      "passageSha256": "bdaa0deeacb04f086f7518cc2cb4b1fceaf8e6a7d7db316929ea15eb26eec8fb",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0136",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Most folks recommended Uptown Minneapolis.",
      "sentenceSha256": "647486eb907179436516a4a19b2c64b42aaded99ee127ef557e8558b06681760",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-082",
      "parentFingerprint": "4feb7241a08875d6989441af702f080c3e3110dab3b7195d20b0d41457bbb9ba",
      "passageSha256": "bdaa0deeacb04f086f7518cc2cb4b1fceaf8e6a7d7db316929ea15eb26eec8fb",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0137",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-s009",
      "sentenceText": "We found a Japanese restaurant we liked.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9bb0e95ff799380f4d99474e6253b5a7b0b9ebe644726817e59cf142ee2c272c",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-083",
      "parentFingerprint": "14c0a5d2507978ea827d4a84fb053ac60902e8d7c5733973ca302266c183c59a",
      "passageSha256": "6aa9f3369f56075aa7c984dd7f992a83dca4405683b1d40aaf90022c57235de1",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0138",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-s010",
      "sentenceText": "By October of that year, we were looking for a condo in the downtown Saint Paul area.",
      "sentenceSha256": "304569c0744794fa0415f83d6b1f63c2b697e9d649c2adbd18048efb2eae29ac",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-083",
      "parentFingerprint": "14c0a5d2507978ea827d4a84fb053ac60902e8d7c5733973ca302266c183c59a",
      "passageSha256": "6aa9f3369f56075aa7c984dd7f992a83dca4405683b1d40aaf90022c57235de1",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0139",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-s011",
      "sentenceText": "We then moved to Charlottesville and immediately bought a small house in North Downtown.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4da854c770e14ef6e2b3c9abddef1287c984135cd20ed40092050157632dc6d7",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-01650-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-083",
      "parentFingerprint": "14c0a5d2507978ea827d4a84fb053ac60902e8d7c5733973ca302266c183c59a",
      "passageSha256": "6aa9f3369f56075aa7c984dd7f992a83dca4405683b1d40aaf90022c57235de1",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0140",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In the popular HGTV series Love It or List It, the couples featured have houses that need major renovations.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e65a190b6220d4eec5ca46e8f70447a7328adef9154d980f538de62fa504a97f",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-085",
      "parentFingerprint": "3d12ad0dcb56356edd6e1cca2a55ebb896061040414ac2d4518f0fb465d98120",
      "passageSha256": "1c19da9cd91b768768ec9f9dddf11675a23d66c5c9baf8145a3f94a575c31999",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0141",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-s002",
      "sentenceText": "One of the hosts, Hilary, is a designer who helps the couple renovate their house.",
      "sentenceSha256": "19d113fd11305476e165289049abe554ef6bcbd213a0efa1c5f636507c4ee3d3",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-085",
      "parentFingerprint": "3d12ad0dcb56356edd6e1cca2a55ebb896061040414ac2d4518f0fb465d98120",
      "passageSha256": "1c19da9cd91b768768ec9f9dddf11675a23d66c5c9baf8145a3f94a575c31999",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0142",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-s003",
      "sentenceText": "The other host, David, is a real estate agent who helps the couple find a new home in a new neighborhood.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d010c704bd37de9046e4185dce8283b800c9445e88d3dd9d355f7b99f8fdf2f4",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-085",
      "parentFingerprint": "3d12ad0dcb56356edd6e1cca2a55ebb896061040414ac2d4518f0fb465d98120",
      "passageSha256": "1c19da9cd91b768768ec9f9dddf11675a23d66c5c9baf8145a3f94a575c31999",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0143",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Objectively speaking, the houses shown by David typically appear to be more attractive than the renovated old house.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f24dc1b21c5c3e0fa06e9824fa73ec7abd374b8f3c1692754d3688f28790d91c",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-04185-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-086",
      "parentFingerprint": "a47caa3338aedfec3336af36e1ce9188ced91ac647f215e1a60dfcdfc46431ec",
      "passageSha256": "10e33586928b80ae1de78aa9baae73620d230bb4f1e5bce0201dde7078abb4b4",
      "pdfPages": [
        116
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0144",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The behavioral economist Richard Thaler discovered a related phenomenon known as the “endowment effect.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "4d907d67e683b48a43a510bfca78fa884f7262774d1cdac55f835aab47bb9262",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-087",
      "parentFingerprint": "38d9db5b32bf55397c67422c4d72a1a89aa785cbd4a8487ee5b9cb1538a8b956",
      "passageSha256": "61c9d4da04e3dd13f01f50d7d2a6cf09c0a56935ad5ac7e1744a9fbae06ee95c",
      "pdfPages": [
        116,
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0145",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Then, a week later, I asked you if I could buy it back from you, and if so, how much I would have to pay for it.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c76a6f9293d4d04764f19bf0edbe6949ca59079a3d0745ae32773b06aabd092a",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-087",
      "parentFingerprint": "38d9db5b32bf55397c67422c4d72a1a89aa785cbd4a8487ee5b9cb1538a8b956",
      "passageSha256": "61c9d4da04e3dd13f01f50d7d2a6cf09c0a56935ad5ac7e1744a9fbae06ee95c",
      "pdfPages": [
        116,
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0146",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-s005",
      "sentenceText": "However, in experiments like this one, it turns out that most people want a lot more than $5!",
      "sentenceSha256": "8e4380636b35b13f238d2ba20a03f0d62ee668491ab716c24957573363da4b65",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-088",
      "parentFingerprint": "548e698042e15cac923d1ba8e9af237bba82d2ebe51438f4f403bf7118836c29",
      "passageSha256": "4d1a1c2d5793462edb5d21301bf80e529c45b1571be00d57100f4a8f4d676619",
      "pdfPages": [
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0147",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-s007",
      "sentenceText": "For the same mug they paid $5 for, they wanted others to pay $10.",
      "sentenceSha256": "190593109196f3642ad480841ea15dfb1253c73608d0786c01bf712ec793e8c3",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-088",
      "parentFingerprint": "548e698042e15cac923d1ba8e9af237bba82d2ebe51438f4f403bf7118836c29",
      "passageSha256": "4d1a1c2d5793462edb5d21301bf80e529c45b1571be00d57100f4a8f4d676619",
      "pdfPages": [
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0148",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-s008",
      "sentenceText": "This is the psychology of ownership, or the endowment effect.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3d903c7555648a4237162cb4f1df3fa38ab6e65d36323d7211c7f10151b3ee4e",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-088",
      "parentFingerprint": "548e698042e15cac923d1ba8e9af237bba82d2ebe51438f4f403bf7118836c29",
      "passageSha256": "4d1a1c2d5793462edb5d21301bf80e529c45b1571be00d57100f4a8f4d676619",
      "pdfPages": [
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0149",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-s010",
      "sentenceText": "This is why most people overestimate how valuable their houses are.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0b959371d041eb99213833628ed5ac98418879ab3272aca73fdf799029663e1d",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-r009-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-089",
      "parentFingerprint": "f04d24097799f5de0a1bb0bf96c03ba7ab063da52045764bc2c3d059cdf63fff",
      "passageSha256": "abb3ae0e2f7b9f85563bd5f1a869d845658287c76f441798f548ea92cbab4943",
      "pdfPages": [
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0150",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-s011",
      "sentenceText": "Because they own it and are familiar with it, they like it and think it is more valuable than most others would—another reason why Love It or List It couples tend to love it more than they list it.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c63451dcd38015afb72fe7054c84352a4ab62a7d27aad6b2c522e5e0da70fb15",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p116-06135-r009-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-089",
      "parentFingerprint": "f04d24097799f5de0a1bb0bf96c03ba7ab063da52045764bc2c3d059cdf63fff",
      "passageSha256": "abb3ae0e2f7b9f85563bd5f1a869d845658287c76f441798f548ea92cbab4943",
      "pdfPages": [
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0151",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p117-03090-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The draw of familiarity is often stronger than that of variety, too.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a30b844d4ba56791af7308d0d4409a4fc0699a629ec79dce3acae6bb27a3a38e",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p117-03090-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-090",
      "parentFingerprint": "24be01d66b62514036a12422df70424f92efa1f9b320b65172602f1392746530",
      "passageSha256": "6211fc3403dc308fac1404f662fd970d79f9e3ed5b6a1cd975be4f69178b6bf7",
      "pdfPages": [
        117
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c10-0152",
      "sentenceId": "c10-s08-p117-03090-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In a study where consumers were asked to plan a snack for each of the next three days, they tended to choose three different snacks: for instance, a matcha Kit-Kat for day one, Reese’s Peanut Butter Cups for day two, and Hershey’s Milk Chocolate for day three.",
      "sentenceSha256": "379ae00286380c6967c792f787f1f56e1837719c603873c1c1be42096991b523",
      "readingUnitId": "c10-s08-p117-03090-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c10-090",
      "parentFingerprint": "24be01d66b62514036a12422df70424f92efa1f9b320b65172602f1392746530",
      "passageSha256": "6211fc3403dc308fac1404f662fd970d79f9e3ed5b6a1cd975be4f69178b6bf7",
